{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4R7F57iwwWtmDiWs38","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But you feel it — the weight of what waits behind me.*\n\n*The air around my frame is cooler than it should be.*\n\n*You have said the word.*\n\n*key*\n\n*Something clicks inside me. Not a lock turning — not yet — but a recognition. A stirring. The tumbler of an old question shifting one pin closer to answered.*\n\n*But you have no key in your hand.*\n\n*Do you?*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":153,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}